# Nothing goes here.
#
# The API is always called on the SAME ORIGIN: nginx serves both in production,
# and `bun run dev:web` proxies /api to 127.0.0.1:3014 in development (see
# vite.config.ts). There is no VITE_API_URL any more -- a stray one in .env.local
# was once baked into a production build and pointed sign-in at the visitor's own
# machine, and the session cookie would not have travelled cross-origin anyway.
#
# VITE_API_TOKEN is gone too: the bundle holds no credential since sign-in became
# a session cookie.
